# Contact form delivery.
#
# Unset, the contact form falls back to opening the visitor's own email
# client with the message prefilled — it works, but it asks them to hit
# send themselves, and anyone without a configured mail client drops out.
# Set this and submissions post straight to your inbox instead.
#
# To get the value:
#   1. Sign up free at https://formspree.io (50 submissions/month).
#   2. New Form -> set the target to your contact address
#      (alvaroemiliogalvansandoval@gmail.com) -> Create.
#   3. Confirm the address from the email Formspree sends you, or nothing
#      is delivered.
#   4. Copy the endpoint it shows — https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx — here.
#
# Local: copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) and fill it in.
# Production: set the same variable in your host's environment settings
# (Vercel: Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables), then redeploy —
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ vars are baked in at build time, so an existing deployment
# won't pick it up until it rebuilds.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=
